From a7d0fd84db6651b589ef0e2cb98819a22c984eaf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Agent <codex-agent@invalid>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 02:11:05 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/7] Preserve typed Skia working storage through coordinated
 pages

Carry actual nonlinear-sRGB F16 working storage through tile allocation, profile-aware NativeImage uploads, copies, effects and ordinary page buffers. Keep physical precision and colour metadata paired through GTK import and retain explicit reduced-gamut transports.

No global Canvas/ImageData pixel-format API enable is introduced. Compilation and focused regressions are pending the coordinating workflow.
